cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RAG-QE-HyTrans: A Quality-Aware Retrieval-Augmented Hybrid Framework for Low-Resource English-Kannada Machine Translation"
message: "If you use this code, configuration, results, or figures, please cite the associated paper and this repository."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Prasad"
    given-names: "Padma"

repository-code: "https://github.com/padmaprasad-ai/rag-qe-hytrans-english-kannada-mt"

abstract: >
  This repository contains the reproducibility package for RAG-QE-HyTrans,
  a quality-aware retrieval-augmented hybrid framework for low-resource
  English-Kannada machine translation. The framework combines pretrained
  NLLB translation, LoRA-based parameter-efficient adaptation, FAISS-based
  semantic translation-memory retrieval, validation-based threshold selection,
  and reference-free quality-aware candidate selection.

keywords:
  - low-resource machine translation
  - English-Kannada translation
  - NLLB
  - LoRA
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - FAISS
  - translation memory
  - quality estimation

license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-25"